      <p>
        Need it quick? We've got you covered. Many signs ship in 3-5 days.
        Rush service available for urgent orders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="benefit-card">
      <div class="benefit-icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Built to Last</h3>
      <p>
        Weather-resistant and durable. Our LED signs work in rain, snow, and extreme temperatures.
        Plus, they come with a solid warranty.
      </p>
    </div>

