{%- comment -%} FAQ Section - Schema Rich {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="faq-section page-width">

  <h2 class="section-title centered">Common Questions About LED Signs</h2>

  <div class="faq-grid" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">How long do LED signs last?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          Our LED signs last 50,000-100,000 hours. That's about 10-15 years if you run them 8 hours a day.
          They're built tough and come with a warranty for peace of mind.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">Can I use LED signs outdoors?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          Yes! Many of our LED signs are weather-resistant and perfect for outdoor use.
          They handle rain, snow, and temperature changes like a champ. Just look for "outdoor rated" in the description.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">How much do custom LED signs cost?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          Prices vary based on size and design, but most custom LED signs range from $150 to $800.
          Simple open signs start around $50. Contact us for a free quote on your specific needs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">Do you deliver to my area in Niagara?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          Absolutely! We deliver throughout the Niagara region including St. Catharines, Niagara Falls,
          Welland, Fort Erie, and Niagara-on-the-Lake. Free delivery on orders over $200.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">Are LED signs easy to install?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          Very easy! Most LED signs plug into a regular outlet and come with mounting hardware.
          Hang it, plug it in, and you're done. Installation guide included with every order.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
      <h3 class="faq-question" itemprop="name">What if I need a sign urgently?</h3>
      <div class="faq-answer" itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
        <p itemprop="text">
          We offer rush service! Same-day or next-day options available for many signs.
          Call us at {{ business_phone }} and we'll do everything we can to meet your deadline.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

